?','EASY','A','According to the notes, marquee content scrolls from right to left by default.'),(1757,12,'How many types of HTML lists are mentioned in the notes?','EASY','C','There are three types: ordered, unordered and description lists.'),(1758,12,'Which tag is used to create an ordered list?','EASY','A','The ol tag creates an ordered list, with li defining its items.'),(1759,12,'Which tag is used to define items inside an ordered list?','EASY','B','The li tag creates individual list items inside an ordered list.'),(1760,12,'What is the default type of an ordered list?','EASY','D','The default ordered list style is numbers.'),(1761,12,'Which attribute specifies the starting value of an ordered list?','EASY','C','The start attribute specifies the starting value of the list style.'),(1762,12,'Which attribute displays an ordered list in reverse order?','EASY','A','The reversed attribute displays the list style in reverse order.'),(1763,12,'Which tag creates an unordered list?','EASY','B','The ul tag creates an unordered list, which displays bullet points by default.'),(1764,12,'What is the default type of an unordered list according to the notes?','EASY','C','The default unordered list type is disc.'),(1765,12,'Which tag defines the description term in a description list?','EASY','A','The dt tag defines the description term.'),(1766,12,'Which tag provides information or a definition for a term in a description list?','EASY','D','The dd tag provides the description definition or information about the term.'),(1767,12,'Which HTML tag is used to create a hyperlink?','EASY','B','The anchor tag a is used to create hyperlinks.'),(1768,12,'Which attribute specifies the destination path in an anchor tag?','EASY','C','The href attribute specifies the path of the page where navigation should happen.'),(1769,12,'What is the default value of the target attribute in an anchor tag?','MEDIUM','A','The default target value is _self, which opens the page in the same tab.'),(1770,12,'Which target attribute value opens a linked page in a new tab?','EASY','D','_blank opens the linked page in a new tab according to the notes.'),(1771,12,'What is the purpose of the title attribute in an anchor tag?','MEDIUM','B','The title attribute displays a message when the mouse cursor is placed over the hyperlink.'),(1772,12,'What is the purpose of the br tag?','EASY','C','The br tag breaks the line so that the following content appears on the next line.'),(1773,12,'What is the purpose of the hr tag?','EASY','A','The hr tag creates a horizontal line.'),(1774,12,'What is the purpose of the iframe tag?','EASY','D','The iframe tag is used to add a different webpage into the current webpage.'),(1775,12,'Which attribute specifies the webpage path in an iframe?','EASY','B','The src attribute specifies the path of the webpage to be embedded.'),(1776,12,'Which type of YouTube or map link should be used inside an iframe according to the notes?','MEDIUM','C','The notes specify that an embed link should be used for a YouTube video or map.'),(1777,12,'Which HTML tag is used to add audio to a webpage?','EASY','A','The audio tag is used to add audio to a webpage.'),(1778,12,'Which attribute makes audio controls visible on a webpage?','EASY','C','The controls attribute makes the audio player controls visible.'),(1779,12,'Which audio attribute plays the audio repeatedly?','EASY','B','The loop attribute makes the audio play repeatedly.'),(1780,12,'What is the purpose of the autoplay attribute in audio?','EASY','D','Autoplay starts playing audio whenever the webpage reloads, according to the notes.'),(1781,12,'Which attribute makes audio muted by default?','EASY','A','The muted attribute makes the audio muted by default.'),(1782,12,'Which HTML tag is used to add a video to a webpage?','EASY','C','The video tag is used to add video content to a webpage.'),(1783,12,'Which video attribute provides an image to display for the video?','MEDIUM','B','The poster attribute provides an 