es?','MEDIUM','C','The pre tag displays pre-formatted content using a monospace font.'),(2068,12,'How many heading tags are available in HTML?','EASY','B','HTML provides six heading tags, from h1 to h6.'),(2069,12,'Which heading tag is the largest according to the notes?','EASY','A','h1 is the largest heading tag, while h6 is the smallest.'),(2070,12,'What is the default size of the paragraph tag according to the notes?','MEDIUM','D','The notes specify the paragraph tag size as 16px.'),(2071,12,'Which HTML tag is used to add an image?','EASY','C','The img tag is used to add an image to a webpage.'),(2072,12,'What is the purpose of the src attribute in the img tag?','EASY','A','src specifies the path of the image.'),(2073,12,'What is the purpose of the alt attribute in an img tag?','MEDIUM','B','alt provides an alternate message displayed if the image does not load.'),(2074,12,'Which attributes are used to resize an image according to the notes?','EASY','C','The height and width attributes are used to resize an image.'),(2075,12,'What is the purpose of the marquee tag?','EASY','D','The marquee tag is used for scrolling content on a webpage.'),(2076,12,'What is the default scrolling direction of marquee content?','EASY','A','According to the notes, marquee content scrolls from right to left by default.'),(2077,12,'How many types of HTML lists are mentioned in the notes?','EASY','C','There are three types: ordered, unordered and description lists.'),(2078,12,'Which tag is used to create an ordered list?','EASY','A','The ol tag creates an ordered list, with li defining its items.'),(2079,12,'Which tag is used to define items inside an ordered list?','EASY','B','The li tag creates individual list items inside an ordered list.'),(2080,12,'What is the default type of an ordered list?','EASY','D','The default ordered list style is numbers.'),(2081,12,'Which attribute specifies the starting value of an ordered list?','EASY','C','The start attribute specifies the starting value of the list style.'),(2082,12,'Which attribute displays an ordered list in reverse order?','EASY','A','The reversed attribute displays the list style in reverse order.'),(2083,12,'Which tag creates an unordered list?','EASY','B','The ul tag creates an unordered list, which displays bullet points by default.'),(2084,12,'What is the default type of an unordered list according to the notes?','EASY','C','The default unordered list type is disc.'),(2085,12,'Which tag defines the description term in a description list?','EASY','A','The dt tag defines the description term.'),(2086,12,'Which tag provides information or a definition for a term in a description list?','EASY','D','The dd tag provides the description definition or information about the term.'),(2087,12,'Which HTML tag is used to create a hyperlink?','EASY','B','The anchor tag a is used to create hyperlinks.'),(2088,12,'Which attribute specifies the destination path in an anchor tag?','EASY','C','The href attribute specifies the path of the page where navigation should happen.'),(2089,12,'What is the default value of the target attribute in an anchor tag?','MEDIUM','A','The default target value is _self, which opens the page in the same tab.'),(2090,12,'Which target attribute value opens a linked page in a new tab?','EASY','D','_blank opens the linked page in a new tab according to the notes.'),(2091,12,'What is the purpose of the title attribute in an anchor tag?','MEDIUM','B','The title attribute displays a message when the mouse cursor is placed over the hyperlink.'),(2092,12,'What is the purpose of the br tag?','EASY','C','The br tag breaks the line so that the following content appears on the next line.'),(2093,12,'What is the purpose of the hr tag?','EASY','A','The hr tag creates a horizontal line.'),(2094,12,'What is the purpose of the iframe tag?','EASY','D','The iframe tag is used to add a different webpage into the current webpage.'),(2095,12,'Which attribute specifies the webpage path in an iframe?','EASY','B','The src attribute specifies the path of the webpage to be embedded.'),(2096,12,'Which type of YouTube or map link should be used inside an iframe according to the notes?','MEDIUM','C','The notes specify that an embed link should be used for a YouTube video or map.'),(2097,12,'Which HTML tag is used to add audio to a webpage?','EASY','A','The audio tag is used to add audio to a webpage.'),(2098,12,'Which attribute makes audio controls visible on a webpage?','EASY','C','The controls attribute makes the audio player controls visible.'),(2099,12,'Which audio attribute plays the audio repeatedly?','EASY','B','The loop attribute makes the audio play repeatedly.'),(2100,12,'What is the purpose of the autoplay attribute in audio?','EASY','D','Autoplay starts playing audio whenever the webpage reloads, according to the notes.'),(2101,12,'Which attribute makes audio muted by default?','EASY','A','The muted attribute makes the audio muted by default.'),(2102,12,'Which HTML tag is used to add a video to a webpage?','EASY','C','The video tag is used to add video content to a webpage.'),(2103,12,'Which video attribute provides an image to display for the video?','MEDIUM','B','The poster attribute provides an image for the video.'),(2104,12,'Which attributes can be used to resize a video?','EASY','D','The height and width attributes are used to resize the video.'),(2105,12,'Which HTML tag creates a table?','EASY','A','The table tag creates an HTML table.'),(2106,12,'Which tag is used to create a row in an HTML table?','EASY','C','The tr tag creates a table row.'),(2107,12,'Which tags are used to provide data inside an HTML table row?','EASY','B','The th and td tags provide data inside a table row.'),(2108,12,'Which HTML table tag provides a title for the table?','EASY','D','The caption tag provides the title of the table.'),(2109,12,'What is the purpose of the cellspacing attribute?','MEDIUM','A','Cellspacing specifies the space between table cells, outside the cell.'),(2110,12,'What is the purpose of the cellpadding attribute?','MEDIUM','C','Cellpadding specifies the space inside a cell between its content and border.'),(2111,12,'Which attribute combines two or more rows in a table?','EASY','B','Rowspan combines two or more rows.'),(2112,12,'Which attribute combines two or more columns in a table?','EASY','D','Colspan combines two or more columns.'),(2113,12,'Which of the following are semantic table tags mentioned in the notes?','MEDIUM','A','The thead, tbody and tfoot tags are semantic table tags.'),(2114,12,'What does the div tag stand for?','EASY','C','Div stands for division.'),(2115,12,'Which type of HTML element is div?','EASY','B','The div element is a block-level element.'),(2116,12,'What is the main purpose of the div tag?','MEDIUM','D','Div is a container used to group elements for styling and layout purposes.'),(2117,12,'Which type of element is the span tag?','EASY','B','Span is an inline-level container used to group text or other inline elements.'),(2118,12,'Which statement correctly describes the difference between div and span?','MEDIUM','C','Div groups larger sections and is block-level; span styles smaller inline content.'),(2119,12,'Why is the span tag commonly used inside a paragraph?','MEDIUM','A','Span is used to style or modify a small part of inline content without affecting the overall layout.'),(2120,12,'What is the main purpose of HTML forms?','EASY','D','Forms are used to collect information from users.'),(2121,12,'Which type of element is the form tag according to the notes?','EASY','B','The form tag is a block-level element.'),(2122,12,'Which form attribute specifies the URL where form data will be submitted?','MEDIUM','A','The action attribute specifies the URL where form data will be submitted.'),(2123,12,'Which form attribute specifies how data is sent to the server?','MEDIUM','C','The method attribute specifies how data is sent, using GET or POST according to the notes.'),(2124,12,'Which attribute controls whether form input autocomplete is enabled or disabled?','MEDIUM','D','The autocomplete attribute defines whether autocomplete is enabled or disabled.'),(2125,12,'How is a label linked to an input element?','MEDIUM','B','The label for attribute must match the id of the input element.'),(2126,12,'Which HTML tag is used to collect user data through different input types?','EASY','C','The input tag is used to collect user data.'),(2127,12,'Which tag creates a dropdown list?','EASY','A','The select tag creates a dropdown list, and option defines its choices.'),(2128,12,'Which tag defines individual choices inside a dropdown list?','EASY','D','The option tag defines the choices inside a select element.'),(2129,12,'What is the purpose of the fieldset tag?','MEDIUM','B','Fieldset groups form elements together and provides a border around them.'),(2130,12,'Which tag provides a caption for a fieldset group?','EASY','C','The legend tag provides a caption for the fieldset group.'),(2131,12,'Which tag collects multiline text input?','EASY','A','Textarea collects multiline text input. Rows and cols specify its visible height and width.'),(2132,12,'Which input attribute makes a field mandatory before form submission?','EASY','D','The required attribute makes the field mandatory to fill before submission.'),(2133,12,'Which input attribute prevents the user from modifying the value?','MEDIUM','B','The readonly attribute prevents the user from modifying the value.'),(2134,12,'Which input type allows a user to select one option from a group?','EASY','C','The radio input type is used to select one option from a group.'),(2135,12,'Which input type allows users to select multiple options independently?','EASY','A','The checkbox input type allows multiple options to be selected independently.'),(2136,12,'How do you make radio buttons work as one group according to the notes?','MEDIUM','D','Radio buttons are grouped by giving them the same name attribute.'),(2137,12,'Which 